{"data": [{"author_id": "1488443663571054592", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:55:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116378501238681711"], "id": "2116378501238681711", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今日早间国际投行中国观点更新（过去 24 小时）：\n\nA 股相对更优，1–2 个月触底反弹可能性更高 — 宏观策略谈中邢自强与王滢指出，MSCI 中国现 10 倍、沪深 300 仍各有约 10%–15% 的估值下调空间，但国家队进场信号明确高调（10 月 9–20 日买入约 150 亿美元，科创/创业板 ETF 占比升至", "url": "https://x.com/martian54166/status/2116378501238681711"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:37:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116026559425564748"], "id": "2116026559425564748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1029, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌 高盛中国午评\n\n📊 SCHOMP -0.30% 科创 50 -1.75%\n上证 50 -0.29% 创业板指 -1.18%\n沪深 300 -0.38% 中证 500 -0.54%\n全 A 股成交额（人民币万亿元）1.02\n\n📉 今早中国 A 股市场出现明显的风险偏好回落行情，AI 硬件标的领跌，投资者正在消化不及预期的三季度业绩。\n⚡ CPO 以及 PCB", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2116026559425564748"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:05:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116199755995099626"], "id": "2116199755995099626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2787, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "宽基 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2116199755995099626"}, {"author_id": "2077533448877858816", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:58:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116273449287213346"], "id": "2116273449287213346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 520, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大A十二连跌，这次真的不只是普通回调。\n截至10月30日，沪深300指数已经连续12周下跌，12周累计跌幅约14%。有媒体援引路透社报道称，这是该指数有记录以来最长的连续周跌纪录。注意，创造纪录的是沪深300，不是上证指数；目前也不能把它说成全球股市的“世界最长纪录”。 https://t.co/nGuudPvUi0", "url": "https://x.com/june52zg/status/2116273449287213346"}, {"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:18:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116338963783033037"], "id": "2116338963783033037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 906, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月30日A股复盘：\n\n大资金全天流出455亿，超大资金流出133亿，散户净流入390亿\n\n北向资金放量至260亿，净流出217亿，量化86%跟随北向走势\n\n超大资金当前策略是\"卖\"，买入前五：白酒、电池、医疗、油气、券商；流出前五：两融、科创50（刺破前低1.3%警戒线）、半导体芯片、数据中心、机器人、AI应用", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2116338963783033037"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:07:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116139908834467987"], "id": "2116139908834467987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 655, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "五中全会闭幕次日 A股三大指数大跌！ https://t.co/7wsOGaP5ES", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2116139908834467987"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:44:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116088805505822817"], "id": "2116088805505822817", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 421, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高盛中国午评\n\nSCHOMP -0.30% 科创 50 -1.75%\n上证 50 -0.29% 创业板指 -1.18%\n沪深 300 -0.38% 中证 500 -0.54%\n全 A 股成交额(人民币万亿元)1.02\n\n今早中国 A 股市场出现明显的风险偏好回落行情,AI 硬件标的领跌,投资者正在消化不及预期的三季度业绩。\nCPO 以及 PCB 板块个股开盘跌幅超", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2116088805505822817"}, {"author_id": "36120873", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:33:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116206928565285375"], "id": "2116206928565285375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 950, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026-10-30 A股收评：午后反扑失败，沪指失守3600，双创重挫，“喝酒吃药+航运红利”抱团，科技硬件血洗\n\n一、指数收盘\n\n• 上证指数：3599.02，-1.44%（最高3660.21，最低3595.26，失守3600）\n\n• 深证成指：10833.78，-2.73%\n\n• 创业板指：2413.63，-4.13%（创2025年8月以来新低）\n\n•", "url": "https://x.com/EnisY/status/2116206928565285375"}, {"author_id": "154574316", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:27:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116371374013050887"], "id": "2116371374013050887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4644, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "2018 年中美贸易战+去杠杆\n\n上证全年跌超 24%，北向全年净流入约 2900 亿，是当时流入最多的一年\n\n2440 点附近越跌越买，2019 年吃到大反弹。\n外资（北向/外资机构）呈现“分批逆势买”的特征 https://t.co/VBLzAYYnCm", "url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2116371374013050887"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:02:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116153823073059030"], "id": "2116153823073059030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 16498, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "顺便说一件小事。最近大盘磨底磨了快两个月，身边不少炒股的朋友天天对着绿了又绿的K线叹气，连平时最爱晒收益的几个老股民都消停了不少，我忙完手头的几份交易复盘笔记，想起来刚才盘面上的异动，顺便说一件小事。 今天尾盘最后十五分钟，几只宽基 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2116153823073059030"}, {"author_id": "1997991145625063424", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:33:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116327791453261914"], "id": "2116327791453261914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月最后一个交易日，A股主要指数集体下跌\n\n全市场成交额约1.6877万亿元，较前一交易日增加约1170亿元，超过4600只股票下跌\n\n这次下跌与前两天有什么不同？\n\n10月28日市场曾经出现普涨反弹，但10月29日、30日连续回落。\n\n10月30日的特点是：\n\n下跌股票数量仍然超过4600只。", "url": "https://x.com/Xiangyiliu520/status/2116327791453261914"}, {"author_id": "2046946959114817536", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:09:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116336766739501066"], "id": "2116336766739501066", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股在10月最后一天，跌得有点狠！\n\nA股又是4600多只股票下跌！\n\n上证跌1.44%，收3599.02点；创业板跌4.13%，科创50跌5.48%。\n\n更值得注意的是，两市成交额约1.67万亿元，较前一交易日放量。\n\n我觉得现在最重要的不是猜底，而是观察科技股能否真正止跌。", "url": "https://x.com/Doudouwajl/status/2116336766739501066"}, {"author_id": "1245898206279389184", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:02:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116138684504273300"], "id": "2116138684504273300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 617, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股10月收官！三大指数集体暴跌，创业板单日重挫4.13%！\n10月30日，A股迎来10月份最后一个交易日，三大指数全线下跌：\n📉 上证指数：3599.02点，下跌1.44%，失守3600点。\n📉 深证成指：10833.78点，下跌2.73%。\n📉 创业板指：2413.63点，下跌4.13%。\n更值得关注的是整个市场的表现：", "url": "https://x.com/TidyWu/status/2116138684504273300"}, {"author_id": "51315943", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:15:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116096567585526014"], "id": "2116096567585526014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 184, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📉 10月30日A股收盘：三大指数集体下跌，创业板指跌超4%，市场赚钱效应明显降温！\n\n今日A股三大指数集体收跌：\n\n🔹 上证指数：3599.02点，跌1.44%\n🔹 深证成指：10833.78点，跌2.73%\n🔹 创业板指：2413.63点，跌4.13%\n🔹 科创50：跌5.48%\n\n📊 市场表现：", "url": "https://x.com/lifeofchives/status/2116096567585526014"}, {"author_id": "2851487822", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:39:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116027261719859223"], "id": "2116027261719859223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 233, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 中国A股行情分析｜2026年10月30日午盘\n📉【10月30日A股午评｜11:30】三大指数低开后跌幅收窄：沪指3640.54点（-0.30%）、深成指11073.08点（-0.58%）、创业板指2487.91点（-1.18%），成长股仍弱于主板。\n📊全市场超2800股下跌，个股跌多涨少；半日成交额、上涨家数暂未可靠核验，不作推算。 https://t.co/C5JEHemXzL", "url": "https://x.com/hiply0625/status/2116027261719859223"}, {"author_id": "1608690462092857346", "created_at": "2026-10-30T11:46:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116134637630283846"], "id": "2116134637630283846", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 271, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【A股收评：双创指数走势均现冲高回落 CPO、PCB等概念板块集体走弱】", "url": "https://x.com/GG28127681/status/2116134637630283846"}, {"author_id": "1889282399152001024", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:29:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115949291839877493"], "id": "2115949291839877493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📉 A股出现明显分化：有人在撤退，有人在疯狂买入？\n\n10月29日，A股三大指数集体收跌。\n\n关键数据：\n上证指数：下跌0.82%。\n深证成指：下跌2.92%。\n创业板指：下跌4.45%。\n两市成交额：1.56万亿元，较前一交易日减少720亿元。\n但有意思的是： https://t.co/E1e477zkXj", "url": "https://x.com/BalenoLayn/status/2115949291839877493"}, {"author_id": "1596822248538755072", "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:19:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116173066854097205"], "id": "2116173066854097205", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国股市近期大幅回调，与出口数据亮眼形成明显背离。 https://t.co/E33Qt5U3kw", "url": "https://x.com/zoe168168/status/2116173066854097205"}, {"author_id": "31083308", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:57:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116514819050512873"], "id": "2116514819050512873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 74, "impression_count": 19572, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "从A股的量能衰竭看股衰是如何酿成的\n\n2026年A股的这轮调整，从量能视角回看，脉络相当清晰：", "url": "https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2116514819050512873"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:20:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115977106018668900"], "id": "2115977106018668900", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1593, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "从不同类型资金的偏好来看，三类市场主力几乎都没在银行板块布局：散户群体进股市大多是冲着赚短线快钱来的，银行股的常年日内波动都不到1%，拿满大半年的收益可能都不如抓一个20cm涨停板赚得多，没人愿意把几十万甚至上百万的活跃资金扔在几乎没有弹性的银行股里躺平吃分红；游资就更不可能碰银行板块", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2115977106018668900"}, {"author_id": "1516587386557579265", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:56:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116122039899787417"], "id": "2116122039899787417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 154, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今晚收盘后我干了件笨事：把今天涨停的和跌得最惨的，摆一张纸上并排看。看了一会儿，后脖颈有点凉。\n\n今天A股十月收官。上证跌1.44%，收3599.02点，3600没守住。4602只在跌，893只在涨。创业板指今天跌4.13%，一个月跌掉23.02%。", "url": "https://x.com/skyvivijun/status/2116122039899787417"}, {"author_id": "1544949349393874947", "created_at": "2026-10-30T07:07:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116064556824813659"], "id": "2116064556824813659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1696, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "技术分析里“筑底”这个词太容易被滥用，现在还远没到可以放心叫“筑底”的阶段。\n\n真正有效的底部，至少需要同时满足几个条件：\n1.  时间消化 拥挤仓位的出清不是一两周能完成的。保险、固收+、部分公募的减仓需要过程，杠杆资金的退出也需要时间。目前科技方向的抛压还在反复出现。\n2.  量能变化", "url": "https://x.com/julianne_prada/status/2116064556824813659"}, {"author_id": "1713359202465251328", "created_at": "2026-10-30T05:31:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116040271758598204"], "id": "2116040271758598204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 211, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "双创午盘：新低之后，还是新低。\n\n创业板指午收 2487.91，跌 1.18%。上午盘中最低探到 2427，把上周五刚创下的年内低点 2494 又捅穿了一次，午盘拉回一点，仍压在 2494 下面。\n\n科创50 午盘跌 1.74%，报约 1207 点，昨天的低点 1220 也踩在了脚下。\n\n先把结构说清楚。科创50 的顶一个比一个低：10 月", "url": "https://x.com/zhou1492987/status/2116040271758598204"}, {"author_id": "1874887449404448769", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116297847096451430"], "id": "2116297847096451430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1517, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "沪深300连跌12周，创下2005年指数发布以来最长纪录，科创50从7月高点跌了40%，10/30单日又跌了5.48%。同一天 $QQQ 盘中跌了2.9%。$KWEB $FXI $BABA $QQQ $NVDA", "url": "https://x.com/youngstockuser/status/2116297847096451430"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:32:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116372701308928183"], "id": "2116372701308928183", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 20233, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "证监会的会议是表态级，不是出手级。它核心传递的是监管层明确维护市场长期平稳运行的态度，是给所有市场参与者释放的长期预期稳定剂，本质上属于态度层面的明确表态，不属于直接向二级市场注入天量增量资金、直接出手托底指数的即时救市操作，指望靠单段文字表态就让下跌趋势立刻反转、指数直接收红大", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2116372701308928183"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1488443663571054592", "name": "火星人", "username": "martian54166"}, {"id": "1128198342859563008", "name": "小明", "username": "ming69621583"}, {"id": "1913965111045398528", "name": "郭", "username": "m0sHown5gS16742"}, {"id": "2077533448877858816", "name": "june", "username": "june52zg"}, {"id": "1380720896038424579", "name": "SU YU-Web4", "username": "suyu2018block"}, {"id": "1305374184", "name": "龍虎哥", "username": "s_hxxtn"}, {"id": "2108191189019381760", "name": "2030FY", "username": "2030FY_X"}, {"id": "36120873", "name": "陆家嘴之眼", "username": "EnisY"}, {"id": "154574316", "name": "Andrey Gorshkov", "username": "9andrey9"}, {"id": "1997991145625063424", "name": "蓝调", "username": "Xiangyiliu520"}, {"id": "2046946959114817536", "name": "豆芽菜", "username": "Doudouwajl"}, {"id": "1245898206279389184", "name": "TidyDragon(泰迪龍🐉)", "username": "TidyWu"}, {"id": "51315943", "name": "Lord of the Chives", "username": "lifeofchives"}, {"id": "2851487822", "name": "金融刀剑【互关✨️必回】", "username": "hiply0625"}, {"id": "1608690462092857346", "name": "糕手！", "username": "GG28127681"}, {"id": "1889282399152001024", "name": "知局 | 财经 · 国际局势 · 市场判断", "username": "BalenoLayn"}, {"id": "1596822248538755072", "name": "不知道", "username": "zoe168168"}, {"id": "31083308", "name": "王海滨的财经闲谈", "username": "wangwatchworld"}, {"id": "15165